<title>SPAIN: Spain's La Seda 1H turnover up 30 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's La Seda 1H turnover up 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish textile group La Seda de Barcelona said late on Wednesday its turnover in the six months to June rose 30 percent year-on-year to 25.53 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>Total sales for export rose to 10.13 billion pesetas, up 47 percent, while domestic sales rose 20 percent to 15.40 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
